{"title":"Usage monitoring","description":"Check the status and request counts of a self-hosted Stirling PDF server through its info API, the in-app dashboard or Prometheus.","unlisted":false,"space":"server","layout":"","article":"<a class=\"doc-space\" data-accent=\"server\" href=\"/Server/\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"14\" width=\"18\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 6.5h.01M7 17.5h.01\"/></svg><span>Self-hosted server</span></a>\n    <h1>Usage monitoring</h1>\n<p>Watch a self-hosted server's health and usage with the built-in info API (all plans), the <strong>Usage Analytics</strong> dashboard (Enterprise) or Prometheus (Team and Enterprise).</p>\n<h2 id=\"info-api\" class=\"anchor-heading\">Info API<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#info-api\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><p>These endpoints return JSON. With login on, every endpoint except <code>/api/v1/info/status</code> needs authentication; from scripts, send an API key in the <code>X-API-KEY</code> header.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Endpoint</th>\n<th>Returns</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>GET /api/v1/info/status</code></td>\n<td>Status and version. Use it for health checks.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>GET /api/v1/info/health</code></td>\n<td>The same as <code>status</code>.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>GET /api/v1/info/uptime</code></td>\n<td>Time since the server started.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>GET /api/v1/info/requests</code></td>\n<td>POST request count, for one endpoint with <code>?endpoint=</code> or for all.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>GET /api/v1/info/requests/all</code></td>\n<td>POST request counts for every endpoint.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>GET /api/v1/info/load</code>, <code>GET /api/v1/info/load/all</code></td>\n<td>The same, for GET requests.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Any <code>requests</code> or <code>load</code> endpoint plus <code>/unique</code></td>\n<td>Unique sessions instead of requests, for example <code>/api/v1/info/requests/all/unique</code>.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>GET /api/v1/info/wau</code></td>\n<td>Weekly active users. Only when login is off.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Counts reset when the server restarts. To turn off everything except <code>status</code> and <code>health</code>, set <code>metrics.enabled: false</code> (<code>METRICS_ENABLED=false</code>); the other endpoints then return HTTP 403.</p>\n<h2 id=\"usage-analytics-dashboard\" class=\"anchor-heading\">Usage Analytics dashboard<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#usage-analytics-dashboard\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><p>With an Enterprise licence and login on, admins can see usage in the app under <strong>Settings → Monitoring → Usage Analytics</strong>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"prometheus\" class=\"anchor-heading\">Prometheus<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#prometheus\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><p>With a Team or Enterprise licence, Stirling PDF can publish Prometheus metrics: HTTP request counts by endpoint, method and session. Below Team, <code>/actuator/*</code> returns HTTP 404 apart from health checks.</p>\n<p>Turn the endpoint on in <code>custom_settings.yml</code> (see <a href=\"/Server/Customisation/Extra-Settings/\">Extra settings</a>) or <code>JAVA_CUSTOM_OPTS</code>, then restart:</p>\n<div class=\"tabs\" data-group=\"config-methods\" data-sync=\"true\" id=\"tabs-0\"><div class=\"tab-list\" role=\"tablist\"><button role=\"tab\" class=\"tab-btn active\" data-value=\"settings\" aria-selected=\"true\">custom_settings.yml</button><button role=\"tab\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-value=\"env\" aria-selected=\"false\">Environment Variable</button><button role=\"tab\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-value=\"docker-compose\" aria-selected=\"false\">Docker Compose</button></div><div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-panel active\" data-value=\"settings\">\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">yaml</span><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">management</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  endpoints</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    web</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      exposure</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        include</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">prometheus,health,info</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    health</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      show-details</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">always</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  prometheus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    metrics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        enabled</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span></code></pre></div>\n</div>\n<div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-panel\" data-value=\"env\">\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">bash</span><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">JAVA_CUSTOM_OPTS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"-Dmanagement.endpoints.web.exposure.include=prometheus,health,info -Dmanagement.endpoint.health.show-details=always -Dmanagement.prometheus.metrics.export.enabled=true\"</span></span></code></pre></div>\n</div>\n<div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-panel\" data-value=\"docker-compose\">\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">yaml</span><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">services</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  stirling-pdf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    environment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      JAVA_CUSTOM_OPTS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"-Dmanagement.endpoints.web.exposure.include=prometheus,health,info -Dmanagement.endpoint.health.show-details=always -Dmanagement.prometheus.metrics.export.enabled=true\"</span></span></code></pre></div>\n</div></div>\n<p>Then point Prometheus at <code>/actuator/prometheus</code>. With login on, it must send an API key in the <code>X-API-KEY</code> header:</p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">yaml</span><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">scrape_configs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">job_name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'stirling-pdf'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    metrics_path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/actuator/prometheus'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    scrape_interval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">15s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    static_configs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">targets</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'your-stirling-pdf-host:8080'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div>\n\n    <div class=\"doc-source\">\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-Tools.github.io/edit/main/docs/Server/Operations/Usage-Monitoring.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M17 3a2.83 2.83 0 1 1 4 4L7.5 20.5 2 22l1.5-5.5L17 3z\"/></svg>\n        Edit this page on GitHub\n      </a>\n    </div>","toc":"<div class=\"toc-title\">On this page</div><ul><li class=\"toc-l2\"><a href=\"#info-api\">Info API</a></li>\n<li class=\"toc-l2\"><a href=\"#usage-analytics-dashboard\">Usage Analytics dashboard</a></li>\n<li class=\"toc-l2\"><a href=\"#prometheus\">Prometheus</a></li></ul>","pager":"<a class=\"pager-link pager-prev\" href=\"/Server/Operations/Clustering/\">\n        <span class=\"pager-dir\">&larr; Previous</span>\n        <span class=\"pager-title\">Clustering</span>\n      </a><a class=\"pager-link pager-next\" href=\"/Server/Operations/Diagnostics/\">\n        <span class=\"pager-dir\">Next &rarr;</span>\n        <span class=\"pager-title\">Diagnostics</span>\n      </a>"}